            "review_title": "Review at Mi Quang Huong Que",
            "review_text": "Michael D\nPrestbury, United Kingdom224 contributions\n0\nAuthentic and different!\nSep 2018 • Solo\nI was taken to this restaurant as part of the Da Nang food tour. The dishes that we tried were my quang ca bo luon - Quang noodles with fish, beef and eel, frog was also an option but gave it a miss this time.\nDishes are served with a small casserole pot with each main ingredient along with noodles and a large rice cracker with sides of fresh lime and green chillies.\nThe dishes were all very tasty and nicely presented, my favourite dishes of the food tour.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 24, 2018",
